msgstr "宽容"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Network %s"
msgstr "网络 %s"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Keeps each device on one link for %ss"
msgstr "将每台设备保持在 %s 的一条链路上"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Everything else (%s)"
msgstr "其他一切（%s）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Note"
msgstr "笔记"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Fill in the fields below to see what this rule does."
msgstr "填写下面的字段以查看此规则的作用。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Named automatically"
msgstr "自动命名"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Goes through"
msgstr "经过"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"One entry per line. A site name such as youtube.com also covers its "
"subdomains. Leave empty to match every destination."
msgstr "每行一个条目。网站名称（例如 youtube.com）也涵盖其子域。留空以匹配每个目的地。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Leave on Any protocol unless the rule is only for one kind of traffic, such "
"as web (TCP) or calls (UDP)."
msgstr "保留任何协议，除非规则仅适用于一种流量，例如 Web (TCP) 或呼叫 (UDP)。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Needs TCP or UDP. Use one port, a range such as 1000-2000, or a list "
"separated by commas."
msgstr "需要 TCP 或 UDP。使用一个端口、一个范围（例如 1000-2000）或以逗号分隔的列表。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Apply the rule to everyone, to specific LAN devices, or to a whole network."
msgstr "将规则应用于每个人、特定 LAN 设备或整个网络。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "A network"
msgstr "一个网络"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Only traffic that enters the router from this network."
msgstr "仅从该网络进入路由器的流量。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "3. Which WAN links?"
msgstr "3. 哪些 WAN 链接？"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Pick the path this traffic takes. Quick presets create the path for you."
msgstr "选择此流量所采用的路径。快速预设为您创建路径。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Send matching traffic through"
msgstr "通过发送匹配的流量"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"\"First\" keeps the other WAN links as backups. \"Only\" never moves traffic"
" to another link: it stops instead of leaking."
msgstr "“首先”保留其他 WAN 链接作为备份。 “仅”永远不会将流量转移到另一个链接：它会停止而不是泄漏。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Most rules do not need these. They narrow what the rule matches or change "
"how it behaves."
msgstr "大多数规则不需要这些。它们缩小规则匹配的范围或改变其行为方式。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Extra matching"
msgstr "额外搭配"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"A priority tag that some apps put on their traffic, such as calls or games "
"(1-63)."
msgstr "某些应用程序在其流量上添加的优先级标签，例如通话或游戏 (1-63)。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Needs TCP or UDP. The port the device sends from; usually left empty."
msgstr "需要 TCP 或 UDP。设备发送的端口；通常留空。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"For experts: the name of a set that already exists in dnsmasq or nftables; "
"its addresses are matched too."
msgstr "对于专家：dnsmasq 或 nftables 中已存在的集合的名称；它的地址也匹配。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Behaviour"
msgstr "行为"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Includes traffic the router sends itself, such as updates and DNS."
msgstr "包括路由器自身发送的流量，例如更新和 DNS。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Keep each device on the same link (sticky)"
msgstr "使每个设备保持相同的链接（粘性）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"New connections from a device follow its earlier ones instead of being "
"spread out."
msgstr "来自设备的新连接会遵循其先前的连接，而不是分散开来。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Keep for (seconds)"
msgstr "保持（秒）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Only used while \"sticky\" is on."
msgstr "仅在“粘性”打开时使用。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Writes a line to the system log for every new connection this rule matches."
msgstr "对于此规则匹配的每个新连接，在系统日志中写入一行。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Show all options"
msgstr "显示所有选项"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Use a template"
msgstr "使用模板"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Test this rule"
msgstr "测试这个规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Rules run from top to bottom: the first match decides which WAN link carries"
" the traffic."
msgstr "规则从上到下运行：第一个匹配决定哪个 WAN 链路承载流量。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Rule name (optional)"
msgstr "规则名称（可选）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Leave empty and the rule is named for you, for example \"youtube.com via "
"Tim\"."
msgstr "留空，规则会为您命名，例如“youtube.com via Tim”。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "What do you want to do?"
msgstr "你想让我做什么？"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Pick the closest match. You can change every detail afterwards."
msgstr "选择最接近的匹配。之后您可以更改每个细节。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "New rule"
msgstr "新规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Open rule \"%s\""
msgstr "打开规则“%s”"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "(disabled)"
msgstr "（已禁用）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Rules checked, in order"
msgstr "按顺序检查规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Type a site or an address to see which rule decides and which WAN link "
"carries it. Try"
msgstr "输入站点或地址以查看哪个规则决定以及哪个 WAN 链接承载它。尝试"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Where does this traffic go?"
msgstr "这些流量流向哪里？"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Uses your saved rules and your unsaved changes to this rule, with the "
"current link status."
msgstr "使用您保存的规则和未保存的对此规则的更改以及当前链接状态。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Uses your saved rules and the current link status. Nothing is changed."
msgstr "使用您保存的规则和当前链接状态。一切都没有改变。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Site or address"
msgstr "站点或地址"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "A site name such as youtube.com, or an IP address."
msgstr "站点名称（例如 youtube.com）或 IP 地址。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Known device"
msgstr "已知设备"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Any device"
msgstr "任何设备"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Pick one, or type an address."
msgstr "选择一个，或输入一个地址。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Device address"
msgstr "设备地址"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Optional. An IP address or a MAC address."
msgstr "选修的。 IP 地址或 MAC 地址。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Port"
msgstr "港口"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "443"
msgstr "第443章"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Optional. Matters only for rules that name a port."
msgstr "选修的。仅适用于命名端口的规则。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Test traffic"
msgstr "测试流量"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Back to the rule"
msgstr "回到规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Change default routing"
msgstr "更改默认路由"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "How should traffic that no rule matches leave?"
msgstr "没有规则匹配的流量应该如何离开？"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "This replaces the generated default path. Your own rules are kept."
msgstr "这将替换生成的默认路径。遵守您自己的规则。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Activity"
msgstr "活动"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Needs attention: %s"
msgstr "需要关注：%s"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/summary.js
#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Needs attention"
msgstr "需要处理"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Clear the search and filter to reorder rules"
msgstr "清除搜索和过滤器以重新排序规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Duplicate routing rule %s"
msgstr "重复路由规则 %s"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Duplicate"
msgstr "复制"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Traffic that no rule above matches (%s)"
msgstr "没有上述规则匹配的流量 (%s)"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "%d of %d rules"
msgstr "%d 之 %d 规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "No routing rule matches."
msgstr "没有匹配的路由规则。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Change the search or the filter to see more rules."
msgstr "更改搜索或过滤器以查看更多规则。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Clear search and filter"
msgstr "清除搜索和过滤器"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "All"
msgstr "全部"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Active"
msgstr "积极的"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Search routing rules"
msgstr "搜索路由规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Search rules, sites or devices"
msgstr "搜索规则、站点或设备"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Show"
msgstr "展示"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Paths to create:"
msgstr "创建路径："

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/rulecheck.js
msgid ""
"Traffic stops while %s is unavailable. Pick \"Use first\" instead if it "
"should keep flowing through another link."
msgstr "当 %s 不可用时，交通停止。如果它应该继续流经另一个链接，请选择“首先使用”。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/rulecheck.js
msgid ""
"This rule lists both site names and addresses, but it only matches traffic "
"that fits both, so it never matches. Saving splits it into one rule for "
"names and one for addresses."
msgstr "此规则列出了站点名称和地址，但它仅匹配适合两者的流量，因此它永远不会匹配。保存将其分为一项用于名称的规则和一项用于地址的规则。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/rulesui.js
msgid "This creates 2 rules: one for names, one for addresses"
msgstr "这将创建 2 条规则：一项用于名称，一项用于地址"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/rulesui.js
msgid "%s (addresses)"
msgstr "%s（地址）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/rulesui.js
msgid ""
"Never matches: it lists both site names and addresses. Edit and save it to "
"split it into two rules."
msgstr "从不匹配：它列出了站点名称和地址。编辑并保存它以将其拆分为两个规则。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Domains and IP addresses are detected automatically. Listing both creates "
"one rule for each kind."
msgstr "自动检测域和 IP 地址。列出两者都会为每种类型创建一个规则。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/summary.js
msgid ""
"No WAN links are set up yet, so all traffic uses the router's normal "
"routing."
msgstr "尚未设置 WAN 链接，因此所有流量都使用路由器的正常路由。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/summary.js
msgid "All WAN links are disabled. Enable one so traffic can use it."
msgstr "所有 WAN 链接均被禁用。启用一个以便流量可以使用它。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/summary.js
msgid ""
"Your WAN links are ready. Choose how traffic that no rule matches should "
"leave."
msgstr "您的 WAN 链接已准备就绪。选择没有规则匹配的流量应如何离开。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/summary.js
#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Choose default routing"
msgstr "选择默认路由"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/summary.js
msgid "Default routing needed"
msgstr "需要默认路由"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/summary.js
msgid ""
"Default routing is missing, so traffic may bypass mwan4. Choose how it "
"should leave."
msgstr "默认路由丢失，因此流量可能绕过 mwan4。选择它应该如何离开。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/summary.js
msgid "Check again"
msgstr "再次检查"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/summary.js
msgid ""
"mwan4 is set up but not fully running, so failover and routing rules may not"
" apply. Restart it to fix this."
msgstr "mwan4 已设置但未完全运行，因此故障转移和路由规则可能不适用。重新启动它来解决这个问题。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/summary.js
msgid ""
"mwan4 is set up but not fully running, so failover and routing rules may not"
" apply. Ask an operator to restart it."
msgstr "mwan4 已设置但未完全运行，因此故障转移和路由规则可能不适用。请操作员重新启动它。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/summary.js
msgid "Starting"
msgstr "开始"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/summary.js
msgid ""
"Waiting for the first link status from mwan4. If this stays empty, restart "
"it."
msgstr "等待来自 mwan4 的第一个链接状态。如果它仍然为空，请重新启动它。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/summary.js
msgid "Everything is working: all %d WAN links are online."
msgstr "一切正常：所有 %d WAN 链路均在线。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Start mwan4 so routing rules and failover apply again."
msgstr "启动 mwan4，以便再次应用路由规则和故障转移。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重新启动"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Restart MultiWAN 4 service"
msgstr "重新启动 MultiWAN 4 服务"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Load the saved settings again. Connections may pause for a moment."
msgstr "再次加载保存的设置。连接可能会暂停一会儿。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Stop mwan4 and remove its routing rules and failover."
msgstr "停止 mwan4 并删除其路由规则和故障转移。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Stop mwan4?"
msgstr "停止 mwan4 吗？"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Stopping mwan4 removes all routing rules and failover until it is started "
"again."
msgstr "停止 mwan4 将删除所有路由规则和故障转移，直到再次启动为止。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Active rules"
msgstr "活动规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "%d disabled"
msgstr "%d 禁用"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Set up MultiWAN in three steps"
msgstr "只需三步即可设置 MultiWAN"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Add your internet connections, choose how traffic leaves by default, then "
"add rules only for traffic that needs a special WAN link."
msgstr "添加您的互联网连接，选择流量默认离开的方式，然后仅为需要特殊 WAN 链接的流量添加规则。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Pick a network interface and two addresses to test it with."
msgstr "选择一个网络接口和两个地址来测试它。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Use one link first with the others as backup, or share load across all "
"links."
