#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"Advanced settings cover tunnels, extra health-check tools and the hand-over "
"to PBR, MPTCP, VRF and FRR/BFD setups."
msgstr "高级设置涵盖隧道、额外的运行状况检查工具以及切换到 PBR、MPTCP、VRF 和 FRR/BFD 设置。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"Most changes are easier on the overview: add WAN links and routing rules "
"there, and keep this page for tunnels and integrations."
msgstr "大多数更改在概览上都比较容易：在其中添加 WAN 链接和路由规则，并保留此页面用于隧道和集成。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/globals.js
msgid "MultiWAN 4 - Global settings"
msgstr "MultiWAN 4 - 全局设置"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/globals.js
msgid "Global settings apply to every WAN link, path and routing rule."
msgstr "全局设置适用于每个 WAN 链接、路径和路由规则。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/globals.js
msgid ""
"Most changes are easier on the overview: open Global settings in its top "
"panel."
msgstr "大多数更改在概览上都比较容易：在顶部面板中打开“全局设置”。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/interfaces.js
msgid ""
"WAN links are the internet connections MultiWAN 4 uses, each with the "
"addresses it pings to test the connection."
msgstr "WAN 链接是 MultiWAN 4 使用的互联网连接，每个链接都有其 ping 测试连接的地址。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/interfaces.js
msgid ""
"Most changes are easier on the overview: add a WAN link or change how it is "
"tested there."
msgstr "大多数更改在概览上都比较容易：添加 WAN 链接或更改其测试方式。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/routes.js
msgid "MultiWAN 4 - Link priorities"
msgstr "MultiWAN 4 - 链路优先级"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/routes.js
msgid ""
"A link priority puts one WAN link into a path, with an order (priority) and "
"a share of the traffic (weight)."
msgstr "链路优先级将一个 WAN 链路放入一条路径中，并具有顺序（优先级）和流量份额（权重）。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/routes.js
msgid ""
"Most changes are easier on the overview: choose the links of a routing rule "
"and their order there."
msgstr "大多数更改在概览上都比较容易：选择路由规则的链接及其顺序。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "MultiWAN 4 - Routing rules"
msgstr "MultiWAN 4 - 路由规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Routing rules are checked from top to bottom; the first one that matches "
"decides which path the traffic takes."
msgstr "从上到下检查路由规则；第一个匹配的决定了流量采用的路径。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Most changes are easier on the overview: add or change routing rules there."
msgstr "大多数更改在概览上都比较容易：在其中添加或更改路由规则。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid "MultiWAN 4 - Paths"
msgstr "MultiWAN 4 - 路径"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid ""
"A path is the list of link priorities a routing rule uses, and what happens "
"when none of them is available."
msgstr "路径是路由规则使用的链路优先级列表，以及当它们都不可用时会发生什么。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid ""
"Most changes are easier on the overview: the routing rule editor builds and "
"reuses paths for you."
msgstr "大多数更改在概览上都比较容易：路由规则编辑器为您构建和重用路径。"

