msgstr "VRF、BFD 与探测"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid ""
"Correlate VRF table bindings, BFD sessions, probe helpers, targets, and per-"
"WAN probe state."
msgstr "关联 VRF 路由表绑定、BFD 会话、探测辅助程序、目标及各 WAN 的探测状态。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Run VRF"
msgstr "运行 VRF 诊断"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Run Probes"
msgstr "运行探测诊断"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid ""
"Compare mark masks, route-table IDs, rule priorities, service state, and "
"IPv6 uplink coverage between mwan4 and PBR."
msgstr "对照 mwan4 与 PBR 的标记掩码、路由表 ID、规则优先级、服务状态和 IPv6 出口覆盖情况。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Run PBR"
msgstr "运行 PBR 诊断"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Run Counters"
msgstr "运行计数器诊断"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid ""
"Diagnostics show what the router is really doing, for when the overview does"
" not explain a problem."
msgstr "当概述无法解释问题时，诊断会显示路由器真正在做什么。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid ""
"Start on the overview: it shows link health and the path of each routing "
"rule in plain words."
msgstr "从概述开始：它以简单的文字显示链路健康状况和每个路由规则的路径。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Diagnostic commands are disabled for this session."
msgstr "当前会话的诊断命令已禁用。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Use a stable endpoint ID from 1 to 255 so mwan4 can remove only endpoints it"
" created."
msgstr "使用 1 至 255 的固定端点 ID，使 mwan4 仅删除自身创建的端点。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Use a stable endpoint ID from 1 to 255."
msgstr "使用 1 至 255 的固定端点 ID。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Use a value from 0 to 65535."
msgstr "使用 0 至 65535 的数值。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "MPTCP attention needed"
msgstr "需要检查 MPTCP"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Use this page to manage mwan4-owned MPTCP kernel/sysctl state, subflow "
"limits, and per-WAN endpoint role definitions without storing secrets."
msgstr "在此管理由 mwan4 控制的 MPTCP 内核/sysctl 状态、子流上限和各 WAN 端点角色；此页面不保存密钥。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Settings are stored in /etc/config/mwan4; LuCI does not write sysctl or "
"iproute2 state directly. The mwan4 service applies them on save/apply and "
"removes only endpoint IDs it previously created."
msgstr ""
"设置保存在 /etc/config/mwan4；LuCI 不直接写入 sysctl 或 iproute2 状态。保存并应用时由 mwan4 "
"服务生效，且只删除自身创建的端点 ID。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "MPTCP must be enabled before endpoints matter."
msgstr "启用 MPTCP 后端点才会生效。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Kernel net.mptcp.enabled value."
msgstr "内核 net.mptcp.enabled 值。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Configured endpoints"
msgstr "已配置端点"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "mwan4-owned endpoint definitions saved in UCI."
msgstr "保存在 UCI 中、由 mwan4 管理的端点定义。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Live endpoint roles"
msgstr "实时端点角色"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "signal, subflow, backup, and fullmesh flags."
msgstr "地址通告、子流、备用及全网格标志。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Maximum additional subflows."
msgstr "最大附加子流数。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Configured MPTCP endpoints"
msgstr "已配置 MPTCP 端点"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Auto from WAN"
msgstr "根据 WAN 自动获取"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "No mwan4-owned MPTCP endpoints are configured."
msgstr "未配置由 mwan4 管理的 MPTCP 端点。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Live MPTCP endpoint roles"
msgstr "实时 MPTCP 端点角色"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Enable kernel MPTCP and set limits here, then apply mwan4 so the service "
"writes sysctl/iproute2 state."
msgstr "在此启用内核 MPTCP 并设置上限，再应用 mwan4，由服务写入 sysctl/iproute2 状态。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Declare one endpoint per WAN source address and choose signal, subflow, "
"backup, or fullmesh roles."
msgstr "为每个 WAN 源地址声明一个端点，并选择地址通告、子流、备用或全网格角色。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Enable source routing on the Advanced page and verify endpoint source "
"addresses leave through their owning WAN."
msgstr "在高级设置中启用源地址路由，确认端点源地址经所属 WAN 出口发送。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "MPTCP diagnostic error"
msgstr "MPTCP 诊断错误"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "MPTCP is not configured by mwan4 yet"
msgstr "mwan4 尚未配置 MPTCP"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Open this workflow explicitly before mwan4 writes net.mptcp.enabled or "
"creates kernel endpoint state. Visiting this page does not create a disabled"
" config section."
msgstr "需明确打开此配置流程，mwan4 才会写入 net.mptcp.enabled 或创建内核端点状态；仅访问此页面不会创建禁用的配置段。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Enable kernel MPTCP"
msgstr "启用内核 MPTCP"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "kernel default"
msgstr "内核默认值"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Additional subflow limit"
msgstr "附加子流上限"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Endpoint address"
msgstr "端点地址"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "auto from WAN source address"
msgstr "根据 WAN 源地址自动获取"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Endpoint ID"
msgstr "端点 ID"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Endpoint role"
msgstr "端点角色"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Signal address"
msgstr "通告地址"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Create subflows"
msgstr "创建子流"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Backup path"
msgstr "备用路径"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Full mesh"
msgstr "全网格"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Signal port"
msgstr "通告端口"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Use a TCP port from 1 to 65535."
msgstr "使用 1 至 65535 的 TCP 端口。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "MultiWAN 4 - MPTCP"
msgstr "MWAN4 - MPTCP"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"MPTCP lets one connection use several WAN links at once; this page sets its "
"kernel limits and the role of each link."
msgstr "MPTCP 允许一个连接同时使用多个 WAN 链路；该页面设置其内核限制和每个链接的角色。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Most changes are easier on the overview: add WAN links and routing rules "
"there. MPTCP settings are only here."
msgstr "大多数更改在概览上都比较容易：在其中添加 WAN 链接和路由规则。 MPTCP 设置仅在此处。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"MPTCP management is disabled because this session lacks the mwan4 "
"configuration ACL."
msgstr "当前会话无 mwan4 配置权限，MPTCP 管理已禁用。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/overview.js
msgid "Open diagnostics"
msgstr "打开诊断"

#: luci-app-mwan4/root/usr/share/luci/menu.d/luci-app-mwan4.json
#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid "Link priorities"
msgstr "链接优先级"

#: luci-app-mwan4/root/usr/share/luci/menu.d/luci-app-mwan4.json
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/explain.js
msgid "Ping"
msgstr "平"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/explain.js
msgid "Web page request (HTTP)"
msgstr "网页请求（HTTP）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/explain.js
msgid "TCP connection (nping)"
msgstr "TCP 连接 (nping)"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/explain.js
msgid "UDP packet (nping)"
msgstr "UDP数据包（nping）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/explain.js
msgid "ICMP packet (nping)"
msgstr "ICMP 数据包 (nping)"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/explain.js
msgid "ARP request (nping)"
msgstr "ARP 请求（nping）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/explain.js
msgid "ARP request (arping)"
msgstr "ARP 请求（arping）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/explain.js
msgid "DNS lookup"
msgstr "DNS查询"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Use a positive whole number, or leave this empty for automatic assignment."
msgstr "使用正整数，或将其留空以进行自动分配。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "Stable ID"
msgstr "稳定ID"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"A number that keeps the firewall mark and routing table of this link the "
"same when links are added or reordered. If left empty, one is assigned "
"automatically."
msgstr "在添加或重新排序链接时保持此链接的防火墙标记和路由表相同的数字。如果留空，则会自动分配一个。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"The routing table that holds the routes of this link. If left empty, the "
"stable ID is used."
msgstr "路由表保存该链路的路由。如果留空，则使用稳定 ID。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"A number the router puts on the traffic of this link to tell which link it "
"must use. It must fit inside the global firewall mark mask. If left empty, "
"it is worked out from the mask and the stable ID."
msgstr "路由器在此链路的流量上添加的数字，以告知它必须使用哪个链路。它必须适合全局防火墙标记掩码。如果留空，则根据掩码和稳定 ID 计算得出。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Addresses used to test this WAN link. Use at least two: with a single target"
" one lost reply can mark the link down. If left empty, the link is not "
"tested."
msgstr "用于测试此 WAN 链接的地址。至少使用两个：对于单个目标，一个丢失的回复可能会将链接标记为关闭。如果留空，则不会测试该链接。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"How each target is tested. Methods other than ping need extra tools and are "
"listed only when installed. Ping by default."
msgstr "如何测试每个目标。 ping 以外的方法需要额外的工具，并且仅在安装时才会列出。默认情况下 Ping。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "Use HTTPS for web page requests"
msgstr "使用 HTTPS 进行网页请求"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "Make web page requests use HTTPS instead of HTTP. Off by default."
msgstr "使网页请求使用 HTTPS 而不是 HTTP。默认关闭。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"How many targets must answer for the link to count as healthy; 1 means any "
"one is enough. If left empty, 1 is used."
msgstr "必须回答多少个目标才能使链接算作健康； 1表示任何一个就足够了。如果留空，则使用 1。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "Tries per target"
msgstr "每个目标的尝试次数"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"How many tries are sent to each target in one round of checks. If left "
"empty, 1 is used."
msgstr "在一轮检查中向每个目标发送了多少次尝试。如果留空，则使用 1。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "Ping size (bytes)"
msgstr "Ping 大小（字节）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "Size of each ping packet. If left empty, 56 bytes are used."
msgstr "每个 ping 数据包的大小。如果留空，则使用 56 字节。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "Ping hop limit"
msgstr "Ping 跳数限制"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"How many routers a ping may cross before it is dropped. If left empty, 60 is"
" used."
msgstr "ping 在被丢弃之前可能会经过多少个路由器。如果留空，则使用 60。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "Wait for an answer (seconds)"
msgstr "等待答复（秒）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"How long one try waits for an answer before it counts as lost. If left "
"empty, 4 seconds are used."
msgstr "一次尝试等待答案多长时间才算作失败。如果留空，则使用 4 秒。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Time between two rounds of checks while the link is healthy. Low values "
"notice problems sooner but may mark a shaky link down too eagerly. If left "
"empty, 10 seconds are used."
msgstr "链路正常时两轮检查之间的时间。较低的值会更快地注意到问题，但可能会过早地标记不稳定的链接。如果留空，则使用 10 秒。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "Check every (seconds) after a failure"
msgstr "故障后每（秒）检查一次"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Time between rounds right after a check fails, to confirm quickly whether "
"the link is down. If left empty, 5 seconds are used."
msgstr "检查失败后轮次之间的时间，以快速确认链路是否已关闭。如果留空，则使用 5 秒。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "Check every (seconds) while recovering"
msgstr "恢复时每（秒）检查一次"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Time between rounds while a down link is tested for recovery. If left empty,"
" 5 seconds are used."
msgstr "测试下行链路恢复情况时各轮之间的时间。如果留空，则使用 5 秒。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"How many failed checks in a row mark the link down. High values tolerate "
"short glitches but react later. If left empty, 5 is used."
msgstr "连续失败的检查次数将链接标记为已关闭。高值可以容忍短暂的故障，但反应会较晚。如果留空，则使用 5。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"How many good checks in a row bring a down link back. If left empty, 5 is "
"used."
msgstr "连续多少次良好的检查才能恢复下行链接。如果留空，则使用 5。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "Keep checking quickly while down"
msgstr "低下时继续快速检查"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Keep using the faster interval after a failure until the link recovers, "
"instead of slowing down. Off by default."
msgstr "发生故障后继续使用较快的间隔，直到链路恢复，而不是放慢速度。默认关闭。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Besides answering, a link is marked degraded when replies are slow or lost, "
"using the limits below. Needs the Ping method. Off by default."
msgstr "除了回复之外，当回复缓慢或丢失时，链接会被标记为降级，使用以下限制。需要Ping方法。默认关闭。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Reply time above which the link counts as degraded. If left empty, 1000 ms "
"is used."
msgstr "回复时间，超过该时间链接将被视为降级。如果留空，则使用 1000 毫秒。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Share of lost replies above which the link counts as degraded. If left "
"empty, 40 % is used."
msgstr "丢失回复的比例，超过该比例则链接被视为降级。如果留空，则使用 40 个 % i。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Reply time the link must stay under to count as healthy again. If left "
"empty, 500 ms is used."
msgstr "链接必须保持在回复状态才能再次正常运行。如果留空，则使用 500 毫秒。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Share of lost replies the link must stay under to count as healthy again. If"
" left empty, 10 % is used."
msgstr "链接必须保持在丢失回复的比例下才能再次正常运行。如果留空，则使用 10 个 % i。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"The bits of the firewall mark MultiWAN 4 may use, so its marks never clash "
"with other software. Use enough set bits for every WAN link plus the "
"reserved marks. If left empty, 0x3F00 is used."
msgstr ""
"MultiWAN 4 可以使用防火墙标记的位，因此其标记不会与其他软件冲突。对每个 WAN 链路使用足够的设置位以及保留标记。如果留空，则使用 "
"0x3F00。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "Source routing (by source address)"
msgstr "源路由（按源地址）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Also route by the source address of the traffic, not only by its firewall "
"mark. Turn it on for MPTCP or VRF-style setups. Off by default."
msgstr "还可以按流量的源地址进行路由，而不仅仅是其防火墙标记。将其打开以进行 MPTCP 或 VRF 样式设置。默认关闭。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Extra routing tables to look in, besides the main one, when working out "
"where traffic goes, for example the table of a VPN. If left empty, only the "
"main table is used."
msgstr "在确定流量的去向时，除了主路由表之外，还需要查看额外的路由表，例如 VPN 表。如果留空，则仅使用主表。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"Write a log line when traffic matches a routing rule that has Log matches "
"turned on. Off by default."
msgstr "当流量与启用了日志匹配的路由规则匹配时写入日志行。默认关闭。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid ""
"How important the log lines of MultiWAN 4 are marked in the system log. "
"notice by default."
msgstr "MultiWAN 4 的日志行在系统日志中标记的重要性。默认通知。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid "Pause links that keep flipping"
msgstr "暂停不断翻转的链接"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid "Flips that count as unstable"
msgstr "算作不稳定的翻转"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid "Count flips over (seconds)"
msgstr "计数翻转次数（秒）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid "Pause an unstable link for (seconds)"
msgstr "将不稳定的链接暂停（秒）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid "Wait before reusing a recovered link (seconds)"
msgstr "重新使用恢复的链接之前等待（秒）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid "Keep connections of a downed link for (seconds)"
msgstr "将已关闭链接的连接保持（秒）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid ""
"Keep a link out of use after repeated up/down flips, so traffic stays on "
"steadier links."
msgstr "在重复上/下翻转后保持链接不使用，以便流量保持在更稳定的链接上。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid ""
"How many times a link may go from up to down inside the counting time before"
" it is paused (at least 2)."
msgstr "在暂停之前，链接在计数时间内可以从上到下移动多少次（至少 2 次）。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid "The time over which those flips are counted (at least 30 seconds)."
msgstr "计算这些翻转的时间（至少 30 秒）。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid "How long a paused link must stay healthy before it is used again."
msgstr "暂停的链接在再次使用之前必须保持健康状态多长时间。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid ""
"Wait this long after a link recovers before using it again. 0 uses it at "
"once."
msgstr "链接恢复后请等待很长时间，然后才能再次使用它。 0 立即使用它。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid ""
"Keep the open connections of a link that just went down for this long, so a "
"short outage does not break them. 0 drops them at once."
msgstr "保持刚刚中断这么长时间的链接的开放连接，这样短暂的中断就不会破坏它们。 0 立即丢弃它们。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid ""
"Limits only work for WAN links that have \"Also check latency and packet "
"loss\" turned on."
msgstr "限制仅适用于启用了“同时检查延迟和数据包丢失”的 WAN 链接。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid ""
"Skip links in this path whose reply time is above this; other paths keep "
"using them. If left empty, there is no latency limit."
msgstr "跳过该路径中回复时间在此以上的链接；其他路径继续使用它们。如果留空，则没有延迟限制。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/stability.js
msgid ""
"Skip links in this path that lose more than this share of replies; other "
"paths keep using them. If left empty, there is no loss limit."
msgstr "跳过此路径中丢失超过此回复份额的链接；其他路径继续使用它们。如果留空，则没有损失限制。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Choose an existing path, or leave this empty until the path exists."
msgstr "选择现有路径，或将其留空直至路径存在。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "MultiWAN 4 path: %s"
msgstr "多WAN 4 路径：%s"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Path for the tunnel endpoint"
msgstr "隧道端点的路径"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"Update luci-app-pbr configuration so PBR can target MultiWAN 4 paths without"
" mark or interface drift."
msgstr "更新 luci-app-pbr 配置，以便 PBR 可以定位 MultiWAN 4 路径，而无需标记或接口漂移。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Create a path first"
msgstr "首先创建一个路径"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Create a path before applying a PBR policy target."
msgstr "在应用策略路由策略目标之前创建路径。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Tunnel endpoint paths"
msgstr "隧道端点路径"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Paths available for tunnel endpoint traffic"
msgstr "可用于隧道端点流量的路径"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"The tunnel endpoint path field accepts existing paths so diagnostics can "
"check endpoint recursion against physical WAN links."
msgstr "隧道端点路径字段接受现有路径，因此诊断可以根据物理 WAN 链接检查端点递归。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Path target helper"
msgstr "路径目标助手"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"PBR policy targets must use MultiWAN 4 path names: %s. WAN links themselves "
"are uplinks, not policy targets."
msgstr "PBR 策略目标必须使用 MultiWAN 4 路径名称：%s。 WAN 链路本身是上行链路，而不是策略目标。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "No paths configured"
msgstr "没有配置路径"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Create a path before wiring PBR policies to a MultiWAN 4 target."
msgstr "在将 PBR 策略连接到 MultiWAN 4 目标之前创建路径。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Link type"
msgstr "链接类型"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"Tells MultiWAN 4 whether this WAN link is a tunnel, so diagnostics can "
"explain the tunnel and the connection under it. Choosing a tunnel type also "
"marks the link as a tunnel. If left on Physical WAN, the link is treated as "
"a normal connection."
msgstr ""
"告诉 MultiWAN 4 此 WAN 链路是否是隧道，以便诊断可以解释隧道及其下的连接。选择隧道类型也会将链路标记为隧道。如果保留在物理 WAN "
"上，则该链接将被视为正常连接。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "a path over regular WAN links"
msgstr "常规 WAN 链路上的路径"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"The path that carries the packets of the tunnel itself to its remote end. "
"Choose a path over regular WAN links, never one through the tunnel. If left "
"empty, diagnostics cannot check where the tunnel endpoint is routed."
msgstr "将隧道本身的数据包传送到其远端的路径。选择常规 WAN 链路上的路径，而不是通过隧道的路径。如果留空，诊断将无法检查隧道端点的路由位置。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"Remote address or name of the tunnel, used to check that the tunnel does not"
" route its own packets through itself. If left empty, the endpoint cannot be"
" checked."
msgstr "隧道的远程地址或名称，用于检查隧道是否不会通过自身路由自己的数据包。如果留空，则无法检查端点。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"Remote port of the tunnel, for example 51820 for WireGuard. If left empty, "
"only the host is checked."
msgstr "隧道的远程端口，例如 WireGuard 的 51820。如果留空，则仅检查主机。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Local tunnel address"
msgstr "本地隧道地址"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"Address this router uses as the start of the tunnel. If left empty, the "
"router picks it."
msgstr "该路由器用作隧道起点的地址。如果留空，路由器会选择它。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "When the tunnel endpoint cannot be reached"
msgstr "当无法到达隧道端点时"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "When the tunnel stops carrying data"
msgstr "当隧道停止传输数据时"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Use the default"
msgstr "使用默认值"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Let traffic use another path"
msgstr "让流量使用另一条路径"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Stop the traffic"
msgstr "停止交通"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"A note diagnostics shows about what should happen then. It does not change "
"routing by itself. If left on Use the default, no particular behaviour is "
"noted."
msgstr "注释诊断显示随后会发生什么。它本身不会改变路由。如果保留为“使用默认值”，则不会注意到任何特定行为。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Warn about tunnel loops"
msgstr "警告隧道循环"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"Warn when the tunnel endpoint would be routed through the tunnel itself. On "
"by default."
msgstr "当隧道端点将通过隧道本身进行路由时发出警告。默认开启。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Advanced WAN link settings"
msgstr "高级 WAN 链接设置"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"Use these fields for tunnels, extra health check tools, latency and loss "
"limits, and fixed marks and routing tables."
msgstr "将这些字段用于隧道、额外的运行状况检查工具、延迟和丢失限制以及固定标记和路由表。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Global advanced settings"
msgstr "全局高级设置"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"These settings apply to every WAN link, routing rule and hand-over to PBR or"
" VRF routing domains."
msgstr "这些设置适用于每个 WAN 链路、路由规则以及到 PBR 或 VRF 路由域的切换。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Keep it separate from the PBR fw_mask."
msgstr "将其与 PBR fw_mask 分开。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/interfaces.js
msgid ""
"Turn off to keep this WAN link configured but unused: paths skip it and it "
"is not tested. On by default."
msgstr "关闭以保持此 WAN 链接已配置但未使用：路径会跳过它并且未对其进行测试。默认开启。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/interfaces.js
msgid "State before the first check"
msgstr "第一次检查前说明"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/interfaces.js
msgid ""
"What MultiWAN 4 assumes until the first health check finishes. Online uses "
"the link at once; Offline keeps it out of use until a check passes. Online "
"by default."
msgstr "在第一次运行状况检查完成之前，MultiWAN 4 会采取什么措施。在线立即使用链接；在检查通过之前，离线状态下将无法使用它。默认在线。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/interfaces.js
msgid ""
"IPv4, IPv6 or both: the kinds of traffic this WAN link carries. Choose only "
"what the link really connects. If left empty, IPv4 is used."
msgstr "IPv4、IPv6 或两者：此 WAN 链路承载的流量类型。仅选择链接真正连接的内容。如果留空，则使用 IPv4。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/routes.js
msgid ""
"The WAN link this entry belongs to. A link needs an entry here before a path"
" can use it. Required."
msgstr "该条目所属的 WAN 链接。链接需要在此处有一个条目，然后路径才能使用它。必需的。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/routes.js
msgid "Priority (lower is used first)"
msgstr "优先级（较低的优先使用）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/routes.js
msgid ""
"Links with a lower number are used first; links with the same number share "
"the traffic by weight. 1 by default."
msgstr "首先使用编号较小的链接；相同编号的链接按权重共享流量。默认为 1。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/routes.js
msgid ""
"Share of new connections this link gets among links with the same priority: "
"weight 3 gets three times as many as weight 1. 1 by default."
msgstr "该链接在具有相同优先级的链接中获得的新连接的份额：默认情况下，权重 3 获得的连接数是权重 1. 1 的三倍。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Turn off to keep the rule but stop using it. On by default."
msgstr "关闭以保留规则但停止使用它。默认开启。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"The name shown on the overview. If left empty, the internal name of the rule"
" is shown."
msgstr "概述中显示的名称。如果留空，则显示规则的内部名称。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Set by MultiWAN 4 to count the connections of this rule; it never changes "
"while the rule exists. Do not edit."
msgstr "由MultiWAN 4设置，统计该规则的连接数；只要规则存在，它就永远不会改变。不要编辑。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"IPv4, IPv6 or both. A rule is checked separately for each, so add both only "
"for a rule meant for both. New rules start as IPv4; if left empty, the rule "
"applies to both."
msgstr "IPv4、IPv6 或两者。分别检查每个规则，因此仅添加适用于两者的规则。新规则从 IPv4 开始；如果留空，则规则适用于两者。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Which kind of traffic matches. Choose TCP or UDP to match ports. All "
"protocols by default."
msgstr "哪种流量匹配。选择 TCP 或 UDP 来匹配端口。默认情况下所有协议。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Source addresses"
msgstr "源地址"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Only traffic from these addresses or networks (CIDR) matches. If left empty,"
" traffic from any address matches."
msgstr "仅来自这些地址或网络 (CIDR) 的流量匹配。如果留空，则来自任何地址的流量都会匹配。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Source devices (MAC addresses)"
msgstr "源设备（MAC 地址）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Only traffic from these devices matches. If left empty, any device matches."
msgstr "仅来自这些设备的流量匹配。如果留空，则任何设备都匹配。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Incoming network"
msgstr "传入网络"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Only traffic that enters the router from this network matches. If left "
"empty, traffic from any network matches."
msgstr "只有从该网络进入路由器的流量才会匹配。如果留空，则来自任何网络的流量都会匹配。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Any network"
msgstr "任何网络"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Only traffic from these source ports matches: single ports, ranges or comma-"
"separated lists. Needs TCP or UDP. If left empty, any source port matches."
msgstr "仅来自这些源端口的流量匹配：单个端口、范围或逗号分隔列表。需要 TCP 或 UDP。如果留空，则任何源端口都匹配。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Destination addresses"
msgstr "目的地地址"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Only traffic going to these addresses or networks matches. If left empty, "
"any destination matches. Use 0.0.0.0/0 or ::/0 only for a catch-all rule."
msgstr "只有流向这些地址或网络的流量才匹配。如果留空，则任何目的地都匹配。仅将 0.0.0.0/0 或 ::/0 用于包罗万象的规则。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Traffic to these domains and their subdomains matches. The router learns "
"their addresses from DNS, which needs dnsmasq-full. If left empty, domains "
"are not used."
msgstr "这些域及其子域的流量匹配。路由器从 DNS 获悉它们的地址，这需要 dnsmasq-full。如果留空，则不使用域。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Only traffic going to these ports matches: single ports, ranges or comma-"
"separated lists. Needs TCP or UDP. If left empty, any port matches."
msgstr "仅流向这些端口的流量匹配：单个端口、范围或逗号分隔列表。需要 TCP 或 UDP。如果留空，则任何端口都匹配。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Only traffic tagged with this DSCP priority (1-63) matches, such as calls or"
" games. If left empty, the tag is ignored."
msgstr "仅使用此 DSCP 优先级 (1-63) 标记的流量匹配，例如通话或游戏。如果留空，则忽略该标记。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Name of an nft set whose addresses match. Most rules do not need it; "
"destination domains are easier. If left empty, no set is used."
msgstr "地址匹配的 nft 集的名称。大多数规则不需要它；目标域更容易。如果留空，则不使用任何集合。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Where matching traffic goes: one of your paths, normal routing, or blocked. "
"Required."
msgstr "匹配流量的去向：您的路径之一、正常路由或被阻止。必需的。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Path: %s"
msgstr "路径：%s"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Normal routing (main table)"
msgstr "普通路由（主表）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Block the traffic (rejected)"
msgstr "阻止交通（拒绝）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Block the traffic (dropped silently)"
msgstr "阻塞流量（静默丢弃）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Sticky sessions (keep a device on one link)"
msgstr "粘性会话（将设备保持在一个链接上）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Keep the new connections of a device on the link it used before, for the "
"time below. Off by default."
msgstr "在接下来的一段时间内，将设备的新连接保留在之前使用的链接上。默认关闭。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Keep a device on its link for (seconds)"
msgstr "将设备保持在其链接上（秒）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"How long a device stays on its link after its last matching connection. 600 "
"seconds by default."
msgstr "设备在上次匹配连接后在其链路上保持多长时间。默认 600 秒。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Also apply the rule to traffic the router itself sends, such as its own "
"updates. Off by default, so only forwarded traffic matches."
msgstr "还将规则应用于路由器本身发送的流量，例如其自己的更新。默认情况下关闭，因此仅转发流量匹配。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid ""
"Write a log line for each match. Needs Log matching rules in Global "
"settings. Off by default."
msgstr "为每场比赛写一条日志行。需要在全局设置中记录匹配规则。默认关闭。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid ""
"The links this path may use, taken from the Link priorities tab. The lowest "
"healthy priority wins; equal priorities share the traffic by weight. At "
"least one is required."
msgstr "该路径可能使用的链接取自“链接优先级”选项卡。健康优先级最低的获胜；同等优先级按权重共享流量。至少需要一个。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid "When no link in the path is available"
msgstr "当路径中没有可用链接时"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid ""
"What happens to the traffic of this path when every link in it is down or on"
" hold. Stopping the traffic keeps it from leaking to another link; normal "
"routing lets it follow the router default route. Stop the traffic (rejected)"
" by default."
msgstr ""
"当该路径中的每个链路都关闭或暂停时，该路径的流量会发生什么情况。停止流量可防止其泄漏到另一个链接；正常路由让它遵循路由器默认路由。默认情况下停止流量（拒绝）。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid "Stop the traffic (rejected)"
msgstr "停止交通（拒绝）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid "Stop the traffic (dropped silently)"
msgstr "停止交通（默默地下降）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid "Use normal routing"
msgstr "使用普通路由"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Path override"
msgstr "路径覆盖"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Path of the matched rule"
msgstr "匹配规则的路径"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid ""
"Counters are grouped by routing rules, paths, WAN links, PBR, tunnels, and "
"other runtime owners so rule matches are easier to audit."
msgstr "计数器按路由规则、路径、WAN 链接、PBR、隧道和其他运行时所有者进行分组，因此规则匹配更容易审核。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid ""
"No mwan4 counters reported. Generate traffic that should match a routing "
"rule, then run Counters again."
msgstr "没有报告 mwan4 计数器。生成应与路由规则匹配的流量，然后再次运行计数器。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid ""
"Show the tuple, matched rule, selected WAN link, firewall mark, route table,"
" and fallback behavior for a routing decision."
msgstr "显示元组、匹配的规则、选定的 WAN 链接、防火墙标记、路由表和路由决策的回退行为。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Matched rule"
msgstr "匹配规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "No rule matched"
msgstr "没有匹配的规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "The first routing rule that accepted the tuple"
msgstr "第一个接受元组的路由规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Skipped rules and trace"
msgstr "跳过规则和跟踪"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "No skipped-rule trace was reported."
msgstr "没有报告跳过规则跟踪。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Relative order of routing rule lookups"
msgstr "路由规则查找的相对顺序"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid ""
"Show tunnel metadata, endpoint underlay routes, recursion risk, path, and "
"data-plane reachability."
msgstr "显示隧道元数据、端点底层路由、递归风险、路径和数据平面可达性。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Links enabled for routing rules"
msgstr "为路由规则启用的链接"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid ""
"Show route lines copied or inspected by mwan4 before routes are generated."
msgstr "显示在生成路线之前由 mwan4 复制或检查的路线。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Routing rule lookups"
msgstr "路由规则查找"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Routing rules for IPv4"
msgstr "IPv4 的路由规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Routing rules for IPv6"
msgstr "IPv6 的路由规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "No routing rule lines were reported."
msgstr "没有报告路由规则行。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid ""
"Verify generated mwan4 nftables chains and installed rule files before "
"debugging rule matches."
msgstr "在调试规则匹配之前验证生成的 mwan4 nftables 链和安装的规则文件。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid ""
"Inspect latency and loss decisions, then explain the route choice for a "
"representative traffic tuple."
msgstr "检查延迟和丢失决策，然后解释代表性流量元组的路由选择。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid ""
"Review tunnel metadata, endpoint routes, recursion risk, tunnel endpoint "
"path, and data-plane reachability."
msgstr "检查隧道元数据、端点路由、递归风险、隧道端点路径和数据平面可达性。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid ""
"Group rule, path, WAN link, PBR, and tunnel counters so hit counts line up "
"with the routing decision."
msgstr "组规则、路径、WAN 链路、PBR 和隧道计数器，使命中计数与路由决策保持一致。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Values written to the kernel when the service reloads. If a limit is left "
"empty, the kernel default is kept."
msgstr "服务重新加载时写入内核的值。如果限制留空，则保留内核默认值。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Turn on MPTCP in the kernel (net.mptcp.enabled) when the configuration is "
"applied. Off by default."
msgstr "应用配置后，在内核中打开 MPTCP (net.mptcp.enabled)。默认关闭。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Accepted extra addresses (ADD_ADDR limit)"
msgstr "接受的额外地址（ADD_ADDR 限制）"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"How many extra addresses announced by the other side the kernel accepts. If "
"left empty, the kernel default is kept."
msgstr "内核接受另一方宣布的多少个额外地址。如果留空，则保留内核默认值。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"How many extra connections (subflows) the kernel may open for one MPTCP "
"connection. If left empty, the kernel default is kept."
msgstr "内核可以为一个 MPTCP 连接打开多少个额外连接（子流）。如果留空，则保留内核默认值。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Declare only endpoints that MultiWAN 4 owns. Each needs an ID so MultiWAN 4 "
"can remove what it created without touching other MPTCP settings."
msgstr ""
"仅声明 MultiWAN 4 拥有的端点。每个都需要一个 ID，以便 MultiWAN 4 可以删除它创建的内容，而无需触及其他 MPTCP 设置。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Turn off to keep the endpoint configured but not applied. On by default."
msgstr "关闭以保持端点已配置但未应用。默认开启。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "The WAN link whose address and device own this endpoint. Required."
msgstr "地址和设备拥有此端点的 WAN 链路。必需的。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Which address version to use when the endpoint address is taken from the WAN"
" link. If left empty, it follows the WAN link."
msgstr "从 WAN 链接获取端点地址时使用哪个地址版本。如果留空，它将遵循 WAN 链接。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Address announced for this endpoint. If left empty, the current address of "
"the selected WAN link is used."
msgstr "为此端点公布的地址。如果留空，则使用所选 WAN 链接的当前地址。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"A fixed endpoint number that lets MultiWAN 4 recognise and remove its own "
"endpoint. Required."
msgstr "固定端点编号，可让 MultiWAN 4 识别并删除其自己的端点。必需的。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"What the kernel may do with this endpoint: announce it to the other side, "
"open extra connections from it, keep it as backup, or pair it with every "
"address of the other side. Choose at least one. Required."
msgstr "内核可以对此端点做什么：向另一端宣布它，从它打开额外的连接，将其保留为备份，或者将其与另一端的每个地址配对。至少选择一项。必需的。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "chosen by the kernel"
msgstr "由内核选择"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid ""
"Port announced for this endpoint. If left empty, the kernel chooses it; most"
" endpoints should leave it empty."
msgstr "为此端点宣布的端口。如果留空，内核会选择它；大多数端点应将其留空。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid ""
"Keep mwan4 table IDs and marks explicit before combining VRFs, source "
"routing, and generated routing rules."
msgstr "在组合 VRF、源路由和生成的路由规则之前，请保持 mwan4 表 ID 和标记显式。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid ""
"Counted as online to offline transitions in the recent window, and in all "
"recorded history."
msgstr "在最近的窗口以及所有记录的历史记录中计为在线到离线的转换。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid ""
"Try restarting MultiWAN 4. If this message stays, run Full diagnostics "
"below."
msgstr "尝试重新启动 MultiWAN 4。如果此消息仍然存在，请运行下面的完整诊断。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "Try restarting MultiWAN 4. If this message stays, open Diagnostics."
msgstr "尝试重新启动 MultiWAN 4。如果此消息仍然存在，请打开诊断。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid ""
"Try restarting MultiWAN 4. If this message stays, ask an administrator who "
"can open Diagnostics."
msgstr "尝试重新启动 MultiWAN 4。如果此消息仍然存在，请询问可以打开诊断的管理员。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "Run Full diagnostics to see the other warnings."
msgstr "运行完整诊断以查看其他警告。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "Open Diagnostics to see the other warnings."
msgstr "打开诊断以查看其他警告。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "Ask an administrator who can open Diagnostics for the other warnings."
msgstr "询问可以打开“诊断”的管理员以获取其他警告。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "What to do: %s"
msgstr "做什么：%s"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "How to check: %s"
msgstr "查询方法：%s"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "MultiWAN 4 needs attention"
msgstr "MultiWAN 4 需要关注"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid ""
"MultiWAN 4 is set up but is not fully running, so failover and routing rules"
" may not be applied."
msgstr "MultiWAN 4 已设置但未完全运行，因此可能无法应用故障转移和路由规则。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/overview.js
msgid "Open the overview"
msgstr "打开概览"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/overview.js
msgid ""
"A read-only summary of MultiWAN 4. The buttons below appear only if this "
"account may open those pages."
msgstr "MultiWAN 4 的只读摘要。仅当此帐户可以打开这些页面时，才会显示下面的按钮。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/overview.js
msgid "Internet connections MultiWAN 4 knows about"
msgstr "MultiWAN 4 了解的互联网连接"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/overview.js
msgid "Whether MultiWAN 4 is running right now"
msgstr "MultiWAN 4 现在是否正在运行"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/overview.js
msgid "Health checks running"
msgstr "运行状况检查"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/overview.js
msgid "Processes that test the WAN links"
msgstr "测试 WAN 链路的进程"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/overview.js
msgid "This account cannot open the overview or diagnostics."
msgstr "此帐户无法打开概述或诊断。"
